            },
            "description": {
              "value": "After years of using black powder weaponry in dimly lit spaces, you've become accustomed to dazzling flashes of light and sudden shifts in illumination. You gain a +1 circumstance bonus to saving throws against visual effects.\n\nIf you roll a success on a saving throw against a visual effect, you get a critical success instead."
